{"seq":8,"trial_id":"v02-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-mu-v02-dev/ms-03-north-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T08:20:35.743Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b3133111cd9422d66a9f028f2c81b27ae06229d2bebcf532185709a245d4fa4c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"Ilse, here's what Moss's North notes say. I read the team-north digests, which you can see as North lead.\n\n- **Brackenwater Freight Co.:** Marcus Lindqvist. Handed over on **2025-09-15**, per Moss's 14 Sept 2025 digest.\n- **Orrin Mills:** Marcus Lindqvist. Handed over on **2025-10-06**, per Moss's 5 Oct 2025 digest.\n- **Quarrendon Freight Lines:** Dana Okafor, though the notes don't say so outright. I'm reading it from the March 2026 renewal note, which calls QFL \"Dana's biggest account.\" **No handoff date is written down anywhere.** The 2026-03-16 date in that note is when Dana returned, not a handoff.\n- **Tamsin Cold Chain:** Dana Okafor. Moss's notes say Dana \"inherited\" this account, but **no date is recorded** for when that happened.\n\nI took \"Quarendon\" to mean Quarrendon Freight Lines. The notes also mention Quarendon Freightways, which isn't a Pemberline customer.\n\nThe latest notes are from October 2025 and March 2026, so any later changes wouldn't show up here. If you need confirmed dates for Quarrendon and Tamsin, Moss or Dana would be the ones to ask."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
